Third-party data and artwork
----------------------------
This license applies to the NodeTaxi source code (the Lua files at the root of
the addon and the scripts in tools/) only. It does not apply to:

  * node coordinate data in data.lua, which is derived from the Forever tables
    of "GatherMate2 Data Wowhead classic" (Marrtin, based on Spinx's data),
    with coordinates originally collected by Wowhead users;
  * the resource artwork in Media/, taken from GatherMate2's Artwork folder
    (Nevcairiel and contributors), which is marked All Rights Reserved in the
    GatherMate2 TOC.

Those components are included with attribution and remain subject to their
original authors' terms. See ATTRIBUTION.md. If you redistribute NodeTaxi,
review those terms (or replace those components) first.
